                    <p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:15.75pt;line-height:19.5pt"><span lang="EN-US">Click on <b>View More</b> to view the listings applications &amp; filings as well as the essential documentation submitted for the listing process. Download the documents related to each proceeding to know the detailed operation.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p><a href="/en/listings-and-prospectus/listing-applications-and-filings">View More</a></p>
                </p>
          </li>
          <li>
                <h2>Public Offerings</h2>
                <p>
                    <p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:11.3pt;line-height:13.95pt"><span lang="EN-US">Learn here about: <o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:11.3pt;line-height:13.95pt"><span lang="EN-US">- The latest public offerings<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:11.3pt;line-height:13.95pt"><span lang="EN-US">- Call Auctions <o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:11.3pt;line-height:13.95pt"><span lang="EN-US">- Auctions Results <s><o:p></o:p></s></span></p>
<p>&nbsp;<span lang="EN-US">- Placement Notices<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p><a href="/en/listings-and-prospectus/public-offerings">View More</a></p>
                </p>
          </li>
          <li>
                <h2>Prospectus</h2>
                <p>
                    <p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:11.3pt;line-height:13.95pt"><strong><span style="font-family: lucida_sans, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 26px;">Learn </span></strong><span style="font-family: lucida_sans, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 26px;">what a prospectus is, <strong>Search</strong> for the prospectus of interest to you, and <strong>Download</strong> it to learn more about the corporate, legal and financial information related to the Companies Listed and the Securities Issued.</span></p>
<p><a href="/en/listings-and-prospectus">View More</a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
                </p>
          </li>
          <li>
                <h2>Listing & Maintenance Fees</h2>
                <p>
                    <p><span style="font-family: lucida_sans, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 26px;">Estimate the listing and maintenance fees applied to securities like shares, CKDs, FIBRAS (REITS), bond issues, among others with the Interactive Calculator and view the listings and maintenance fees in effect at the BMV.</span></p>
<p><a href="/en/listings-and-prospectus/listing-and-maintenance-fees">View More</a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:11.3pt;line-height:13.95pt"><span lang="EN-US"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
                </p>
          </li>
 
    </ul>
    </div>
			
